### 学生登录：请先运行这一段，IDE 会保存 JSESSIONID Cookie
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "address_student_0922",
  "password": "Test12345"
}

###

### 食堂与档口，档口项应包含 dishCount
GET http://localhost:8080/api/canteens/1/stalls

###

### 公开评价，无须登录
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews

###

### 当前学生评价，需要学生登录 Cookie
GET http://localhost:8080/api/student/reviews

###

### 当前学生购物车，需要学生登录 Cookie
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items

###

### 商家登录：运行后会替换为商家 Session
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "merchant_test",
  "password": "12345678"
}

###

### 商家订单，需要商家登录 Cookie
GET http://localhost:8080/api/merchant/orders

###

### 商家首页，需要商家登录 Cookie
GET http://localhost:8080/api/merchant/dashboard/summary